                <mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;골든 정본 &lt;i&gt;artifacts/ablation/v6/a42_*&lt;/i&gt; · 실전 정본 &lt;i&gt;newset 17/20 · heldout_v2 17/18 · heldout_v3 15/16&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;코드가 정본이다 — &lt;i&gt;src/argus/ablation.py&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;agent/pipeline.py&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;agent/aggregate.py&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;agent/reasoning.py&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;agent/tools.py&lt;/i&gt;. 도면이 코드와 어긋나면 코드가 맞다.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
